<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell against the dollar and pound on Tuesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 596.6136 to the dollar compared with Monday's 596.4453.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling exchanged at a mean rate of 1,010.3681 compared to Monday's mean of 1,009.4867.</p>
</text>
